  "final_answer": "I have successfully found the answer. Here are the instructions for subscribing to daily listing emails for new submissions in a specific category on arXiv:\n\n## How to Subscribe to Daily Listing Emails for New Submissions in a Specific Category\n\n**Important:** The email must be sent as plain ASCII txt. Richtext format emails will be ignored by the system, as will UTF-8 characters within the subject field.\n\n### Step 1: Determine which archive is of interest to you\n\nA complete list of available archives can be found on the arXiv website. Archives are divided into two types:\n\n### Step 2a: For archives divided into subject classes (math, physics, cs, q-bio, q-fin)\n\nThese archives require you to indicate the specific categories in the body of the message.\n\n**Example using the physics archive:**\n```\nTo: physics@arxiv.org\nSubject: subscribe John Smith\nadd Biophysics\ndel Plasma Physics\n```\n\nYou can also use the short subject class codes (e.g., `q-fin.RM` for Risk Management in Quantitative Finance):\n```\nTo: q-fin@arxiv.org\nSubject: subscribe John Smith\nadd RM\n```\n\n### Step 2b: For archives NOT divided into subject classes\n\nSend an email in this form:\n```\nTo: arch-ive@arxiv.org\nSubject: subscribe Your Full Name\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```\nTo: quant-ph@arxiv.org\nSubject: subscribe John Smith\n```\n\n**Note:** Subscribing to subdivided archives (like `cond-mat`) this way will subscribe you to all subject classes within that archive.\n\n### Special case: Subscribing to specific subject classes within astro-ph, cond-mat, or nlin archives\n\nYou must use the physics archive. For example, to subscribe only to cond-mat subject classes \"Soft Condensed Matter\" and \"Superconductivity\":\n```\nTo: physics@arxiv.org\nSubject: subscribe John Smith\nadd Soft Condensed Matter\nadd Superconductivity\n```\n\n### To Cancel a Subscription\n\nSend an email to the archive's email address with:\n```\nSubject: cancel\n```\n\nThe instructions were found at **Help → Find and Read Articles → Subscribe to daily listing emails** (https://info.arxiv.org/help/subscriptions.html).",
